Provenance
----------

The `platform/` directory is derived from EdgeTX
(https://github.com/EdgeTX/edgetx), Copyright (C) EdgeTX and OpenTX
contributors, licensed under GPL-2.0. Files are taken from EdgeTX commit
96ab2745d1bc0025c5508ac8a3b862f34cf97c6e (2026-09-07) by the script
`tools/vendor-edgetx.sh`, which records the exact list of paths copied.
Every file keeps its original EdgeTX header. Modifications made for ZelionTX
are marked in the file or recorded in `platform/CHANGES.md`.

Third-party components inside `platform/` keep their own licences:
LVGL (MIT), FreeRTOS kernel (MIT), FatFs (BSD-style), STM32 HAL and CMSIS
(BSD-3-Clause), lz4 (BSD-2-Clause), UF2 (MIT), stb (MIT or public domain).

No code from ExpressLRS (GPL-3.0) or Rotorflight (GPL-3.0) is included.
Their wire protocols are re-implemented from the notes in `docs/research/`,
which describe observed behaviour and constants, not source text.

The dashboard logic in `src/dash/` is a port of ZelionDash
(https://github.com/gcholdingscorporation/zelionpowerflightdashboard), by the
same authors, relicensed here under GPL-2.0-only.
